// Artifact placeholder/file matching rules:
// 1) The CMake embed step scans this template for placeholders shaped as
//    @ARTIFACT_<UPPERCASE_NAME>_BYTES@ (and matching _SIZE placeholders).
// 2) For each placeholder, it strips the ARTIFACT_ prefix and _BYTES suffix,
//    lowercases the remainder, and appends .bin.
//    Example:
//      ARTIFACT_BYTECODE_V1_0_0_ALL_SECTIONS_BYTES
//      -> bytecode_v1_0_0_all_sections.bin
// 3) The resolved file is loaded from tests/artifacts/bytecode/binary and
//    inlined into the generated bytecode_artifacts.hpp header.
// 4) Keys in BYTECODE_ARTIFACTS are expected to use the same lowercase base
//    name as the file stem to keep config name, binary name, and lookup key
//    aligned.

